<Base title="Download Learning Site Editor"><section class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">Download</p><h1>The editor for a learning site you own.</h1><p class="lede">Learning Site Editor is a Windows desktop app for creating, editing, previewing, synchronizing, and publishing learning websites.</p></section><ReleaseCard /><section class="prose"><h2>Before you install</h2><p>Windows 10 or later is required. The installer is delivered from the official GitHub Releases page; no installer binaries are stored in this website repository.</p><h2>Install in three steps</h2><ol><li>Download the Windows installer above.</li><li>Run the installer and follow its prompts.</li><li>Open Learning Site Editor and choose <strong>New site</strong> or <strong>Connect repository</strong>.</li></ol><p>Need a different version or want to inspect changes? Use the release notes link above.</p></section></Base>
